	(text_box "SUPERVISOR U502 MAX809S\n\nThreshold [2.85;3.00]V. Reset held 140ms after power-up.\n\n3V3 below threshold -> PR_N = 0 -> relay open, latch cleared (counted as power cycle)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.57 86.36 0)
		(size 57.15 19.05)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "09d58d8a-bb3a-48ad-b323-fcc45c6aa049")
	)
	(text_box "THRESHOLD LADDER R501 / R502 / R503\n\nI_max = 500W / 48V = 10.42A. Worst-case error +-1.59A -> trip defined at 8.7A.\n\nVth_Hi = 3.3*(27.4k + 22.1k)/86.9k = 1.880V -> (1.880 - 1.650)/26.4mV/A = 8.70A.\n\nVth_Lo = 3.3*22.1k/86.9k = 0.839V -> -30.7A (sensor-fault failsafe).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 86.36 0)
		(size 57.15 22.86)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b28c353a-bc19-42c2-9ea2-6701e57b1c91")
	)
	(text_box "COMPARATORS U501 TLV1702\n\nA: V_SENSE > Vth_Hi -> overpower. \n\nB: V_SENSE < Vth_Lo -> sensor fault.\n\nWired outputs: either comparator low -> FAULT_N = 0.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 73.66 86.36 0)
		(size 39.37 20.32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "eb5b9a03-6f57-4dcb-b8ef-04a029cc5da3")
	)
	(text_box "LATCH AND RELAY ENABLE U503 74LVC00\n\nU503A: TRIP = NAND(FAULT_N, TRIP_N)\n\nU503B: TRIP_N = NAND(PR_N, TRIP)\n\nU503C: RELAY_EN_N = NAND(TRIP_N, PR_N)\n\nU503D: RELAY_EN = NOT RELAY_EN_N\n\n-> RELAY_EN = TRIP_N AND PR_N. \nAny fault latches TRIP = 1 until the next power cycle.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 173.99 86.5908 0)
		(size 55.88 26.4392)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "efab1a65-2de2-4fb6-a648-30f995a03582")
	)
